msgstr "テナボルト停電補償金"

#: scenes/addons/random_events/power_outage/power_outage_controller.gd
msgid "Unscheduled power outage (Floor {floor_num})"
msgstr "予定外の停電 (フロア {floor_num})"

#: scenes/addons/random_events/power_outage/power_outage_controller.gd
msgid ""
"Dear tower residents,\n"
"\n"
"The tower is experiencing power failure on floor {floor_num}.\n"
"\n"
"Recovery is expected on {datetime}.\n"
"\n"
"We are terribly sorry for the inconvenience caused.\n"
"\n"
"Tenabolt Power Corporation"
msgstr ""
"タワー住民の皆様へ\n"
"\n"
"フロア {floor_num} にて停電が発生しています。\n"
"\n"
"復旧予定: {datetime}\n"
"\n"
"ご不便をおかけし大変申し訳ございません。\n"
"\n"
"テナボルト電力株式会社"

#: scenes/addons/random_events/power_outage/power_outage_controller.gd
msgid "Scheduled power outage (Floor {floor_num})"
msgstr "計画停電 (フロア {floor_num})"

#: scenes/addons/random_events/power_outage/power_outage_controller.gd
msgid ""
"Dear tower residents,\n"
"\n"
"This is a scheduled power maintenance notice for floor {floor_num}.\n"
"\n"
"Expect power outage to start on {start} and end on {end}.\n"
"\n"
"Tenabolt Power Corporation"
msgstr ""
"タワー住民の皆様へ\n"
"\n"
"フロア {floor_num} の計画停電のお知らせです。\n"
"\n"
"停電開始: {start}、終了: {end}\n"
"\n"
"テナボルト電力株式会社"

#: scenes/addons/random_events/power_outage/power_outage_mod.gd
msgid "Power outage on floor {floor_num}."
msgstr "フロア {floor_num} で停電が発生しました。"

#: scenes/addons/random_events/power_outage/power_outage_mod.gd
msgid "Power restored on floor {floor_num}."
msgstr "フロア {floor_num} の電力が復旧しました。"

#: scenes/addons/random_events/power_surge/power_surge_controller.gd
msgctxt "accounting_item"
msgid "tenabolt power surge reimbursement"
msgstr "テナボルト電力サージ補償金"

#: scenes/addons/random_events/power_surge/power_surge_controller.gd
msgid "Power surge alert (Floor {floor_num})"
msgstr "電力サージ警報 (フロア {floor_num})"

#: scenes/addons/random_events/power_surge/power_surge_controller.gd
msgid ""
"Dear tower residents,\n"
"\n"
"Reports indicate of an imminent power surge on floor {floor_num} to start on {start} and end on {end}.\n"
"\n"
"Ensure all electrical devices are disconnected on the affected floor or they will be damaged (even if they are on warranty).\n"
"\n"
"Tenabolt Power Corporation will not be liable for any asset loss incurred.\n"
"\n"
"Tenabolt Power Corporation"
msgstr ""
"タワー住民の皆様へ\n"
"\n"
"フロア {floor_num} にて電力サージが発生する見込みです。開始: {start}、終了: {end}\n"
"\n"
"該当フロアのすべての電気機器を切断してください。切断しない場合、保証期間中であっても損傷します。\n"
"\n"
"テナボルト電力株式会社は発生した資産損失について責任を負いません。\n"
"\n"
"テナボルト電力株式会社"

#: scenes/addons/random_events/power_surge/power_surge_mod.gd
msgid "Power surge on floor {floor_num}."
msgstr "フロア {floor_num} で電力サージが発生しました。"

