msgstr "大切な人と今すぐチャットしよう。"

#: scenes/graph_network_simulation/users/types_v3/early_access/producers/essential_service/core_mailing.tscn
msgid "A basic email service provider who has consistent low bandwidth usage, and enable residents to read and send email. "
msgstr "安定して低帯域幅で利用でき、住民がメールの読み書きを行えるベーシックなメールサービスプロバイダー。"

#: scenes/graph_network_simulation/users/types_v3/early_access/producers/essential_service/software.tscn
