msgstr "最高のプライバシー設定で監視データを保存できるようにします。"

#: scenes/graph_network_simulation/users/types_v4/early_access/unlockable/consumers/exclusive/ai_researching.tscn
msgid "A researcher who designs, develops, and studies artificial intelligence systems to advance the field through research, experimentation"
msgstr "研究と実験を通じてAI分野を発展させるために人工知能システムを設計、開発、研究する研究者"

#: scenes/graph_network_simulation/users/types_v4/early_access/unlockable/consumers/exclusive/ai_researching.tscn
msgid "do confidential research"
msgstr "機密研究を行う"

#: scenes/graph_network_simulation/users/types_v4/early_access/unlockable/consumers/exclusive/chips_designing.tscn
msgid "A highly specialized engineer who designs the architectural blueprints and detailed circuit layouts for microprocessors, memory chips, and other semiconductor devices"
msgstr "マイクロプロセッサ、メモリチップ、その他の半導体デバイスのアーキテクチャ設計図と詳細な回路レイアウトを設計する高度な専門エンジニア"

#: scenes/graph_network_simulation/users/types_v4/early_access/unlockable/consumers/exclusive/chips_designing.tscn
msgid "do chips designing"
msgstr "チップ設計を行う"

#: scenes/graph_network_simulation/users/types_v4/early_access/unlockable/consumers/exclusive/professional_streaming.tscn
msgid "A professional e-sports streamer broadcasting live gameplay on gaming platforms, entertaining viewers with competitive gaming content."
msgstr "ゲームプラットフォームでライブゲームプレイを配信し、競技ゲームコンテンツで視聴者を楽しませるプロeスポーツストリーマー。"

#: scenes/graph_network_simulation/users/types_v4/early_access/unlockable/consumers/exclusive/professional_streaming.tscn
msgid "do gameplay streaming"
msgstr "ゲームプレイストリーミングを行う"

#: scenes/graph_network_simulation/users/types_v4/early_access/unlockable/consumers/low_bandwidth_user/binge_watching.tscn
msgid "An individual who watches multiple movies lasting several hours without breaks in a single sitting."
msgstr "一度に数時間の映画を休憩なしで何本も視聴する個人。"

#: scenes/graph_network_simulation/users/types_v4/early_access/unlockable/consumers/low_bandwidth_user/jazz_streaming.tscn
msgid "A tower dweller who loves jazz music and enjoys listening to various jazz artists."
msgstr "ジャズ音楽を愛し、さまざまなジャズアーティストの曲を楽しむタワー住民。"

#: scenes/graph_network_simulation/users/types_v4/early_access/unlockable/consumers/low_bandwidth_user/jazz_streaming.tscn
msgid "stream jazz music"
msgstr "ジャズ音楽をストリーミング"

#: scenes/graph_network_simulation/users/types_v4/early_access/unlockable/consumers/loyal_user/base.tscn
msgid "A home-based person who handles work, shopping, and household tasks online. They stick to familiar websites unless better options appear."
msgstr "仕事、買い物、家事をオンラインで処理する在宅の人。より良い選択肢が現れない限り、慣れたウェブサイトを利用する傾向。"

#: scenes/graph_network_simulation/users/types_v4/early_access/unlockable/consumers/loyal_user/large_file_storing.tscn
msgid ""
"An individual who requires background tasks like large cloud backups, or data processing, but tolerant of interruptions as long as it completes eventually. \n"
"\n"
"They stick to familiar websites unless better options appear."
msgstr ""
"大規模なクラウドバックアップやデータ処理などのバックグラウンドタスクを必要とするが、最終的に完了する限り中断には寛容な個人。\n"
"\n"
"より良い選択肢が現れない限り、慣れたウェブサイトを利用する傾向。"

#: scenes/graph_network_simulation/users/types_v4/early_access/unlockable/ixp/base.tscn
#: scenes/graph_network_simulation/users/types_v4/early_access/unlockable/ixp/variant_a.tscn
#: scenes/graph_network_simulation/users/types_v4/early_access/unlockable/ixp/variant_b.tscn
msgid "Internet exchange points are neighbouring buildings that exchange services with the current tower.  "
msgstr "インターネットエクスチェンジポイントは、現在のタワーとサービスを交換する近隣ビルです。"

#: scenes/graph_network_simulation/users/types_v4/early_access/unlockable/ixp/base.tscn
#: scenes/graph_network_simulation/users/types_v4/early_access/unlockable/ixp/variant_a.tscn
