#: scenes/locations/tutorials/1_basic_game_control_floor.tscn
msgid "Click either 'OK' button or the panel to complete the guide."
msgstr "'OK'ボタンまたはパネルをクリックしてガイドを完了します。"

#: scenes/locations/tutorials/1_basic_game_control_floor.tscn
msgid "Basic Movements"
msgstr "基本操作"

#: scenes/locations/tutorials/1_basic_game_control_floor.tscn
msgid "click OK button to continue"
msgstr "OKボタンをクリックして続行"

#: scenes/locations/tutorials/1_basic_game_control_floor.tscn
msgid "You can zoom in or zoom out by scrolling mouse wheel."
msgstr "マウスホイールでズームイン/ズームアウトできます。"

#: scenes/locations/tutorials/1_basic_game_control_floor.tscn
msgid "zoom in/out"
msgstr "ズームイン/ズームアウト"

#: scenes/locations/tutorials/1_basic_game_control_floor.tscn
msgid ""
"There are three ways to move:\n"
"\n"
"The first method is to hold the right mouse button to pan and move."
msgstr ""
"移動方法は3つあります：\n"
"\n"
"1つ目は右マウスボタンを押しながらパンして移動する方法です。"

#: scenes/locations/tutorials/1_basic_game_control_floor.tscn
msgid "hold right mouse to move"
msgstr "右マウスボタン長押しで移動"

#: scenes/locations/tutorials/1_basic_game_control_floor.tscn
msgid "The second method is to hold the middle mouse button while the camera follows the position of the mouse cursor."
msgstr "2つ目は中マウスボタンを押しながら、カメラがマウスカーソルの位置に追従する方法です。"

#: scenes/locations/tutorials/1_basic_game_control_floor.tscn
msgid "hold middle mouse to move"
msgstr "中マウスボタン長押しで移動"

#: scenes/locations/tutorials/1_basic_game_control_floor.tscn
msgid "The third method is to use WASD to move the camera, and hold Shift to move faster across the area."
msgstr "3つ目はWASDキーでカメラを移動し、Shiftキーを押しながら高速移動する方法です。"

#: scenes/locations/tutorials/1_basic_game_control_floor.tscn
msgid "type 'WASD' to move"
msgstr "WASDキーで移動"

#: scenes/locations/tutorials/1_basic_game_control_floor.tscn
msgid "Hold the left mouse button to pick up and move objects."
msgstr "左マウスボタンを押してオブジェクトを持ち上げて移動します。"

#: scenes/locations/tutorials/1_basic_game_control_floor.tscn
msgid "pick and move device (debugger)"
msgstr "デバイス（デバッガー）を掴んで移動"

#: scenes/locations/tutorials/1_basic_game_control_floor.tscn
msgid "Drag one end of power cable (from wall socket) into socket area of the \"Boulder\" to power up \"Boulder\"."
msgstr "壁コンセントからの電源ケーブルの片端を「Boulder」のソケットエリアにドラッグして「Boulder」に電源を入れます。"

#: scenes/locations/tutorials/1_basic_game_control_floor.tscn
